@startuml Matchday V5 Clock Domain
title Matchday V5 - Dominio del reloj oficial

hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

enum MatchClockStatus {
  not_started
  running
  regulation_time_reached
  deadline_reached
  closed
}

class Match {
  +MatchPeriod current_period
  +datetime period_started_at
  +datetime period_ended_at
  +int announced_added_minutes
  +int clock_version
  +datetime regulation_time_alerted_at
  +datetime period_deadline_alerted_at
  --
  +start(now): void
  +start_period(period, now): void
  +set_period_added_time(period, minutes): void
  +end_period(period, now): void
  +clock_snapshot(now): MatchClockSnapshot
}

class MatchClockSnapshot <<value object>> {
  +MatchPeriod period
  +MatchClockStatus status
  +int minute
  +int second
  +int added_minute
  +int elapsed_seconds
  +int remaining_seconds
  +datetime deadline_at
  +int announced_added_minutes
  +int version
  +datetime as_of
}

class SynchronizeMatchClocksUseCase <<background service>> {
  +execute(): int
}

class MatchClockPublisher <<WebSocket>> {
  +publish_snapshot(match_id, snapshot): void
  +publish_alert(match_id, alert, snapshot): void
}

Match ..> MatchClockSnapshot : calcula
MatchClockSnapshot --> MatchClockStatus
SynchronizeMatchClocksUseCase ..> Match : revisa cada 30 segundos
SynchronizeMatchClocksUseCase --> MatchClockPublisher

note right of Match
  No existe pausa ni contador persistido.
  El deadline se deriva del inicio,
  la duración del periodo y el añadido.
end note

note bottom of SynchronizeMatchClocksUseCase
  Publica correcciones y alertas.
  Nunca cambia el periodo automáticamente.
end note
@enduml
